8f681fb.jpg\n\nhttps://cdn.donmai.us/original/08/60/__shiki_haruomi_and_orifushi_akina_kanojo_x_kanojo_x_kanojo_drawn_by_happoubi_jin__0860368016700d49844e5729abc50189.jpg\n\n私のリクエストを読んでいただきありがとうございます。\n\nhttps://cdn.donmai.us/sample/f8/5b/__night_angel_last_origin_drawn_by_0marusankaku__sample-f85b7e28e659d03905838076091ab94b.jpg", "nc": 160, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Moechiki/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3836050, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fef624a1/uploads/origins/1ce27b9c-696f-4e64-9568-5ba1247ab577?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f75a6537509d1dfb558dcc1ad34ef77", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fef624a1/uploads/origins/1ce27b9c-696f-4e64-9568-5ba1247ab577?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f75a6537509d1dfb558dcc1ad34ef77, https://si.imgix.net/fef624a1/uploads/origins/1ce27b9c-696f-4e64-9568-5ba1247ab577?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acf8969750c3d1c8ee136c556ae08010 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fef624a1/uploads/origins/1ce27b9c-696f-4e64-9568-5ba1247ab577?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0a5d99ec818e4af0b6c59419fa0cd23 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fef624a1/uploads/origins/1ce27b9c-696f-4e64-9568-5ba1247ab577?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=28bdb8645e712907d812f5db4afc5353", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fef624a1/uploads/origins/1ce27b9c-696f-4e64-9568-5ba1247ab577?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=28bdb8645e712907d812f5db4afc5353, https://si.imgix.net/fef624a1/uploads/origins/1ce27b9c-696f-4e64-9568-5ba1247ab577?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f1eae618c9e2f711f62d29b8d1edd135 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fef624a1/uploads/origins/1ce27b9c-696f-4e64-9568-5ba1247ab577?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=55267ef3fe5665e3340da1eba7212014 3x"}, "body": "こんにちわ\n\nめぞん一刻の音無響子さんの全身立ち絵で、\n昭和初期の農婦のコスプレイラストをリクエストしたいです。\n表情、ポーズ等はお任せします。\n\n恰好\n野良着に、もんぺ、地下足袋履きで、手には紺の農作業用の手甲をつけています。\n野良着の色は紺で絣模様、\nもんぺはへその辺りで紐を結ぶ袴式、長さはくるぶしまでで、色、模様は濃い紫系の縞、\n脇は袴の様にスリットを開けてほしいです。\n地下足袋はくるぶしの上までの長さ、色は黒にしてほしいです。\n服装の大まかなイメージは資料urlをご参照ください。\nもんぺイメージ\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/27dregu6fv4xgh3/ms.jpg?dl=0\n地下足袋イメージ\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/0dlq0el8hrwkh15ocjvm7/tb.png?rlkey=id9szwe2vs7xqr6f46enheggn&st=gqb9dkf7&dl=0\n\n以上ご検討の程宜しくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/wg5lyu8hc19bmf7ox91ll/si.png?rlkey=bqx1xzta6w4chhlusi4y5li7w&st=ifp4o0d9&dl=0", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Moechiki/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3836050, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1ec659a9/uploads/origins/1cad406d-d934-497f-8204-815f8b144db2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b81598c175a2f57fe46e8699b0de943", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1ec659a9/uploads/origins/1cad406d-d934-497f-8204-815f8b144db2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b81598c175a2f57fe46e8699b0de943, https://si.imgix.net/1ec659a9/uploads/origins/1cad406d-d934-497f-8204-815f8b144db2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1429370343a2117d7dfaefeb114979f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1ec659a9/uploads/origins/1cad406d-d934-497f-8204-815f8b144db2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51624f6e94f6e75b0b7a70577e6b1920 3x"}, "dura